Unknown properties, the missing product, and an unknown property of the product, in the toolchain's order.
--- project.yaml
modules: [a, b]
--- a/module.yaml
foo: 1
description: !x [b]
--- b/module.yaml
product:
  bar: 1
  type: !t jvm/lib
baz: 2
--- expected
a/module.yaml:1:1: ERROR: Product type definition is missing. Define a product using a `product:` declaration.
b/module.yaml:3:9: ERROR: Unexpected custom YAML type tag
b/module.yaml:2:3: ERROR: Unknown property `bar`
b/module.yaml:4:1: ERROR: Unknown property `baz`
